### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Runtime snapshot
GET http://localhost:8000/runtime/snapshot
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Admin dashboard
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/dashboard
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Cases
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/cases
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Queue
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/queue
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Settings
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/settings
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Update initial payment
POST http://localhost:8000/admin/settings/payments.m1_initial_payment
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"value":45000}

### Lawyers
GET http://localhost:8000/admin/lawyers
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token

### Create lawyer
POST http://localhost:8000/admin/lawyers
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name":"Иван Петров","email":"ivan@example.com","workload_limit":20}

### Run scheduler once
POST http://localhost:8000/admin/scheduler/run-once
x-admin-token: dev-admin-token
